      117.06,
      477.46,
      233.44,
      488.53
    ],
    "text": "Declaration under Section 5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      501.46,
      297.78,
      560.53
    ],
    "text": "I, Nalaka Jude Harin Fernando, Minister of Tourism and Lands, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      573.46,
      297.77,
      644.53
    ],
    "text": "The land allotments depicted in Advance Tracing No. Maha/GIK/2014/536 dated 10.10.2018 prepared by Surveyor General situated in the Village of Katukitula in Grama Niladhari Division of Pitakanda (1054) in Divisional Secretary's Division of Ganga Ihala Korale in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded and in extents of as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      657.46,
      297.77,
      716.53
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot A \u2013 Galpethiyaya Pitakanda (1054) \u2013 Extent: 8.3740 Hectares North: Galpethiyaya Claimant unknown; East: Galpethiyaya Claimant unknown and Galpethiyaya Claimant by D.G. Amarasena; South: Road, Galpethiyaya Claimant by",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.25,
      453.42,
      549.78,
      500.49
    ],
    "text": "Gunasinhe and W. Karunapala and Galpethiyaya Claimant unknown; West: Galpethiyaya Claimant by Babynona and some others, Galpethiyaya claimant by Agilin and some others and Galpethiyaya Claimant unknown.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.25,
      513.42,
      549.77,
      560.49
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot B \u2013 Galpethiyaya Pitakanda (1054) \u2013 Extent: 9.0027 Hectares North, East, South and West: Galpethiyaya Claimant unknown.",
    "fonts": [
